      "detailed_description": "<h1>Continuity Recommendations</h1><p>Considering the continuity of the story, we do not recommend a separate purchase for players who have not cleared Shan Gui and Bai Qu.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>As the autumn comes, sweet osmanthus's fragrant is pervading Zijin Mountain again.<br>This is an AVG game produced by Magenta Factory, follow the storyline of Shan Gui and Bai Qu, with an innovative comic book style display.<br>The Episode 1 &amp; 2 of the game now published.<br>The whole story tells about He Jia and Han Hui's reunion, in the sweet and mild autumn season.<br>You will be guided by the girls, once again, enjoy a fantastic autumn journey of the ancient Chinese city of Nanjing.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>AVG in manga-style<br></li><li>Very attractive BGM<br></li><li>With only one end<br></li><li>A relax and gentle story</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Voice</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Han Hui - Luttefair<br></li><li>He Jia - Yinshuijing<br></li><li>Li Qiucheng - Zuoye Yangguang<br></li><li>He Ren - Cotton Candy<br></li><li>He Dai - Linglixin<br></li><li>Chen Kongling - Kagamikuma<br></li><li>Eryue Lan - Xinyue Bingbing　<br></li><li>Floral Goddess - Xiange<br></li><li>Rivulet Nymph - Zisu Jiuyue</li></ul>",
